    "name": "ColumnUnnestList",
    "owner": null,
    "crate": "datafusion-expr",
    "version": "55.1.0",
    "kind": "struct",
    "signature": "struct ColumnUnnestList",
    "docs": "Represent the unnesting operation on a list column, such as the recursion depth and\nthe output column name after unnesting\n\nExample: given `ColumnUnnestList { output_column: \"output_name\", depth: 2 }`\n\n```text\n  input             output_name\n ┌─────────┐      ┌─────────┐\n │{{1,2}}  │      │ 1       │\n ├─────────┼─────►├─────────┤\n │{{3}}    │      │ 2       │\n ├─────────┤      ├─────────┤\n │{{4},{5}}│      │ 3       │\n └─────────┘      ├─────────┤\n                  │ 4       │\n                  ├─────────┤\n                  │ 5       │\n                  └─────────┘\n```",
